  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 200°C/180°C fan-forced.\n• Cut mini flour tortillas into wedges. Slice red onion in half. Thinly slice 1/2 the onion, then finely chop the remainder. Finely chop celery and garlic. Drain lentils. Drain sweetcorn. Grate carrot. Finely chop coriander (reserve some for garnish!). Set aside.\n• In a small bowl, combine the white wine vinegar and a good pinch of sugar and salt. Scrunch sliced onion in your hands, then add to pickling liquid. Add enough water to just cover onion. Stir to coat, then set aside.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/62675ff5fe39b1417d034732/step-fab4043f.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over high heat. Cook corn kernels until lightly charred, 4-5 minutes (cover with a lid if kernels are \"popping\" out!).\n• Meanwhile, finely chop tomato. Roughly chop baby spinach leaves.\n• In a medium bowl, combine tomato, baby spinach, charred corn, chopped coriander and some pickling liquid (1 tsp for 2 people / 2 tsp for 4 people). Season with salt and pepper.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/62675ff5fe39b1417d034732/step-21ad1223.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Place tortilla wedges on a lined oven tray in a single layer.\n• Drizzle (or spray) with olive oil, season with salt and pepper and turn to coat.\n• Bake until golden, 6-8 minutes. TIP: If the tortilla wedges don't fit in one layer, divide them between two oven trays.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/62675ff5fe39b1417d034732/step-9769cb99.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• SPICY! You may find the spice blend hot! Add less if you're sensitive to heat.\n• Return frying pan to medium-high heat with a drizzle of olive oil. Cook celery, carrot and chopped onion until softened, 3-4 minutes.\n• Add garlic, tomato paste, Mexican Fiesta spice blend (see ingredients) and cook until fragrant, 1-2 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/62675ff5fe39b1417d034732/step-b30e6501.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Stir through the water, the butter and the lentils. Simmer until sauce is thickened, 1-2 minutes. Season to taste.\n• Sprinkle shredded Cheddar cheese (see ingredients) on top, then cover with a lid or foil and reduce heat to low. Cook until cheese is melted, 2-3 minutes. TIP: Add another splash of water to loosen the mixture, if needed.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/62675ff5fe39b1417d034732/step-96ced3ce.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Drain pickled onion.\n• Divide tortilla chips between plates.\n• Top with cheesy lentils, light sour cream, corn salsa and pickled onion.\n• Serve sprinkled with reserved coriander. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/62675ff5fe39b1417d034732/step-3d1eecb9.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
